LC 904 — Fruit Into Baskets

Algorithm
Keep a window with at most 2 different fruits.
Add fruits from the right.
If there are 3 types → remove from the left.
Keep the maximum window length.


CODE:
class Solution {
public:
    int totalFruit(vector<int>& f) {
        unordered_map<int,int> mp;
        int l=0, ans=0;

        for(int r=0;r<f.size();r++) {
            mp[f[r]]++;

            while(mp.size()>2) {
                if(--mp[f[l]]==0) mp.erase(f[l]);
                l++;
            }

            ans=max(ans,r-l+1);
        }
        return ans;
    }
};

EX:
fruits = [1,2,1,2,3]

[1,2,1,2] → 2 types → length 4 ✅

Add 3:
[1,2,1,2,3] → 3 types ❌

Remove from left until only 2 types:
[2,1,2,3] → still 3 ❌
[1,2,3] → still 3 ❌
[2,3] → 2 types ✅

Maximum = 4
